{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_03_end","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_03","title":"首次遇襲","storyCode":"MB-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"6fad10b36661df0bd38e46bdb323c4adf0c6fc9e4c5e673e036fa43c29f7274a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"刺殺突如其來，羅賓被捲入其中並陷入昏迷，而同樣被捲入其中的卡夫卡則順利和安東尼建立了聯繫。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"A區囚犯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個囚犯好強！其他囚犯都被他幾下就放倒了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......去死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個獄警也很厲害，但是，她為什麼好像只是在防守......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，獄警倒下了.....）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（只剩下我了，但是要是我在這裡和他戰鬥的話，之後要怎麼解釋。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（怎麼辦，難道只能動手了嗎。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......真快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（安東尼，救下了我？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道你們是誰，但是你們不該這麼做，不該在我的眼前這麼做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，死到臨頭了還關心別人嗎，真是紳士作風啊，安東尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼時候？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，小姑娘，別怪我，要怪就怪你運氣不好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，除了安東尼，我們不想殺人，你就在這睡一會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"（被他得手了......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"(意識，開始模糊了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓我們來......招待你......安東尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......死......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到梅爾小姐你的廚藝真不錯呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，沒想到吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，被捲入了另一個殺手的刺殺中然後昏迷過去了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"真是不幸呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，好倒楣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼這場刺殺是怎麼收場的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們知道安東尼肯定贏了，但是畢竟這可是發生在監獄中的刺殺，不會就草草了之的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不過因為那時候羅賓還昏迷著，所以要從卡夫卡那邊講了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，卡夫卡不也被那個囚犯打暈過去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，她說那是她裝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......原來如此，確實有她之前表現出的風格呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"說，是誰派你們來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......嘿......你不會......知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"B區囚犯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......昏過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人難道是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......罷了，現在想這些也沒有意義，先看看這些囚犯的狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"囚犯們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅賓","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"看來他們確實沒有下死手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這個小姑娘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道是誰，但是剛才幫助了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，不知名的小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你可以叫我卡夫卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你沒暈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別動，身體往右邊挪一下，擋住監控。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"可以了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這樣監控應該看不到我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好我打掃房間的時候觀察了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，你可以叫我卡夫卡，我是來幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不過真是倒楣，本來想找個機會給你留個紙條就完事了的，結果沒想到正好撞上他們出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡不是可以說話的地方，你知道哪裡可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......獄警們該聽到動靜趕過來了，我們可以去醫務室，那裡可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事！安東尼，你在搞什麼鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我想問的，巴頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這些囚犯裡混進了想要刺殺我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你在搞什麼鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的，巴頓隊長，我看到那兩個囚犯把安東尼先生圍了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？你不是看著他們的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警B","speakerId":"avg_npc_136","isRemote":false,"text":"我被那兩個囚犯放倒了，他們挺......很強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，沒用的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"發生這種事，你讓我怎麼向典獄長交待？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"先解決現狀吧，巴頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩個人都是刺客，你們處理一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，但是，安東尼先生，你看，這件事我們不能就因為你的一面之詞就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我受了點傷，需要先去醫務室一趟，其他人都被他們打昏了，也送去醫務室看一看比較好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"去過醫務室後，我自然會去和你詳細說說這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴頓","speakerId":"avg_npc_135","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個還愣著幹什麼，把這兩具屍體丟去停屍間，這些人也都拖出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"avg_npc_137","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Morgue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"獄警們都走了，安東尼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼，我看他們都很慌張的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這裡是安全的，卡夫卡小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"杜瑪是我的朋友，如果說我在這座監獄裡有能夠信任的人，那就只有她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，不要叫我小姑娘，我只是個子矮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這傢伙，明明是囚犯，卻比外面的人還要有禮貌誒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼就是這樣的，他對誰都很有禮貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，明明很能打，卻又很有禮貌，難怪這裡的其他人都覺得你很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"過獎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，輪到我問問題了。你似乎是來協助我的，也就是說，你知道這些來刺殺我的人的來歷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......在那之前，我要先問你一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"請問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道自己家，或者說以你父親的姓氏命名的西蒙公司究竟發生了什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你知道的話，我就不用解釋得很複雜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的父親受到了十多項指控，我知道這背後肯定不簡單，但具體的我沒有時間去瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你知道，那倒是好辦一點了，西蒙公司因為非......非什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想說，非法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對！非法走私源石製品罪！反正公司直接被查封了，公司核心成員全都進了監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你的家人現在都還全部在堡壘山城監獄服刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我很早就做好了心理準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"他們沒死，我已經很高興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"海德兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"海德兄弟，果然是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想，赫默怎麼說的來著......對了，你的家族，西蒙家族原本和他們是在某條線上的競爭關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你們互相占著這條線50%的利益，而且經常會有一些摩擦，而他們一直想要把你們這一份也占了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"然後他們就做了，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......海德兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我經常聽父親提起這個名字，甚至去過他們公司做客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"居然為了一點私欲就做出這樣的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽說過一些類似的事情，只是沒想到居然真的發生在我身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，你沒事吧，需要我用法術舒緩一下你的精神嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，謝謝你，杜瑪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，我早有心理準備，只是沒有想到事實來得這麼突然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你，卡夫卡小姐，我想你沒有任何理由在這件事上欺騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那些刺客應該是海德兄弟派來的吧，他們為什麼事到如今才來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我是真的不知道，不過根據我的經驗，剛才那絕對不是唯一的一波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"他們肯定派了好幾波人來刺殺你，也就是說，把這當成剛剛開始比較好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你呢，想必你不是只為了幫我抵擋這些殺手而來的吧？你的目的是什麼，卡夫卡小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我？嗯......一時半會不好解釋，反正我是受人委託來幫你越獄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你不想出去報仇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你判的是終身監禁，而且是沒有假釋的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要離開這裡，那麼你的選擇就只有一個，那就是——越獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"而我正是來幫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，你要是不願意出去，想在這裡待一輩子，我當然也不會硬要拉你出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"越獄......但是從沒有人能夠順利逃出這座監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，說是這麼說，但是總是要試一試的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已經來到這座監獄一段時間了，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"那你應該聽說了一些我的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他們都說你是最強的囚犯也是最自由的囚犯，大部分囚犯都覺得你很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在也覺得你挺厲害的，這種時候都還能保持冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"......但事實並不是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我再有所謂的人格魅力，身為囚犯，想要折服這些獄警乃至典獄長也是不可能的，我本不應當獲得現在的地位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這倒是沒錯，但它就是發生了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，我得到了獄卒們的優待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"至少據我所知，典獄長親口交代他們，對我“好一點”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年我一直在懷疑，我在來到鑄鐵城後被捕，然後來到這座監獄，是不是我父親一開始安排好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"他預見到了什麼，而提前將我送到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我總是在想這樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，赫默也是這麼說的，不過她說這也只是一種可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，是你背後的人的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......算了，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"事後我會感謝這位朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，如你所說，這也只是一種可能性，如果我想知道原因，我就必須出去，這件事只有我自己才能搞清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜瑪","speakerId":"char_441_lotus","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼，告訴她真的沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。我暫且相信你，卡夫卡小姐，所以我願意向你開誠佈公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你沒來，即使我早已習慣了在這座監獄的生活，我也無時不刻地想要離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"我能在這裡獲得大部分我想要的東西，但是對於如何離開這裡卻也始終沒有頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"所以其實應該是我請求你，卡夫卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東尼","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"請你協助我越獄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_214_Kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["卡夫卡","安東尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_441_lotus","aliases":["杜瑪"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["羅賓"]}]}
